10. Integration with ConectandoEnsenada

Output JSON maps directly to places + business_details + place_media
After human approval → insert with status = 'pending' or 'active'
Embeddings can be stored in the ai.embeddings table
Sources can be stored for transparency and future re-verification


11. Success Metrics

% of drafts approved with zero or minimal edits
Average confidence score of approved listings
Time from input → approved listing
Number of businesses processed per week
Reduction in manual data entry time


Version 1.0 — City Intel Pipeline
This system is designed to grow.
Every new data source and every human correction should make the next version smarter.
